      "raw_count": 5,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "蕭景先，南蘭陵蘭陵人，太祖從子也。祖爰之，員外郎。父敬宗，始興王國中軍。",
